      "text": "char                1 byte (8 bits)                   it is techincally signed on x86-64\n                                                          linux systems but never reyl on it\nsigned char       1 byte                              guaranteed sign (-128 to 127 or 0 to 255)\n\nshort              2 byte                             small integer -32,768 to 32,767\n\nint                 4 bytes                            -21.billion to +2.1billion\n\nlong int           8 byte                        TRAP 8 bytes on linux but only 4 bytes on windows.\n\nlong long int     8 bytes                            guaranteed > 8 bytes +-9.2quintillion.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "char                1 byte (8 bits)                   it is techincally signed on x86-64\n                                                          linux systems but never reyl on it\nsigned char       1 byte                              guaranteed sign (-128 to 127 or 0 to 255)\n\nshort              2 byte                             small integer -32,768 to 32,767\n\nint                 4 bytes                            -21.billion to +2.1billion\n\nlong int           8 byte                        TRAP 8 bytes on linux but only 4 bytes on windows.\n\nlong long int     8 bytes                            guaranteed > 8 bytes +-9.2quintillion.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
