      "text": "unsigned char                1 byte (8 bits)                   0-255\n\nunsigned short              2 byte                              0-65535\n\nunsigned int                  4 bytes                            4.29 billion\n\nunsigned long int            8 byte                  TRAP 8 bytes on linux but only 4 bytes on windows.\n\nunsigned long long int      8 bytes                           guaranteed > 8 bytes 1.8 * 10^19\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "unsigned char                1 byte (8 bits)                   0-255\n\nunsigned short              2 byte                              0-65535\n\nunsigned int                  4 bytes                            4.29 billion\n\nunsigned long int            8 byte                  TRAP 8 bytes on linux but only 4 bytes on windows.\n\nunsigned long long int      8 bytes                           guaranteed > 8 bytes 1.8 * 10^19\n",
